{"book":"2-kings","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:24:02.427795034Z","verse":23,"ref":"2-kings 19:23","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":19,"translation":"By the hand of your messengers you have reproached Adonai, and have said: “With the multitude of my chariots I have gone up to the height of the mountains, to the innermost recesses of Lebanon; and I will cut down the height of its cedars, the choicest of its cypresses; and I will enter ⟨its⟩ farthest lodging, the forest of its orchard.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ביד","gloss":"By the hand"},{"surface":"מלאכיך","gloss":"of your messengers"},{"surface":"חרפת","gloss":"you have reproached"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"Adonai"},{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"and have said"},{"surface":"ברכב","gloss":"By"},{"surface":"רכבי","gloss":"my chariots"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"עליתי","gloss":"⟨have⟩ ascended"},{"surface":"מרום","gloss":"to the height"},{"surface":"הרים","gloss":"of the mountains"},{"surface":"ירכתי","gloss":"the innermost recesses"},{"surface":"לבנון","gloss":"of Lebanon"},{"surface":"ואכרת","gloss":"and I ⟨have⟩ cut down"},{"surface":"קומת","gloss":"the height"},{"surface":"ארזיו","gloss":"of its cedars"},{"surface":"מבחור","gloss":"the choicest"},{"surface":"ברשיו","gloss":"of its cypresses"},{"surface":"ואבואה","gloss":"and I ⟨have⟩ entered"},{"surface":"מלון","gloss":"lodging"},{"surface":"קצה","gloss":"of its border"},{"surface":"יער","gloss":"forest"},{"surface":"כרמלו","gloss":"of its orchard"}]}